# Brainrototo.com - Content & Catalogue

## Catalogue V1

Maintain ~20–30 brainrots as structured data (TS/JSON), not JSX cards.

Each entry: `id`, `name`, `animal`, `ingredient`, `vibe`, `image`, optional `rarity`.

Adding a brainrot = new data row + image asset. **Zero component edits.**

## Traits

Keep trait enums/lists in data modules (animals, ingredients, vibes). UI reads from data.

## Naming

Combo-derived names are fine for V1 (e.g. Fragolafrogo, Melonsharko). Keep naming logic outside presentational components.

## Products

V1 types only: tshirt, hoodie, cap. Product mockups compose `baseImage` + selected brainrot `image`.

## Assets

- Placeholders OK early; keep paths centralized
- Illustrations are the star - prioritize large, clean character art
- Decorative stickers/blobs are secondary and optional per section

## Copy tone

Internet / meme / streetwear. Short, punchy. CTAs as brand language, not form language.
